<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-copy/60">Partner programme · Version 1.1 · 25 November 2026</p>

<p>Between <strong>AIRA WELLNESS ECOM FZCO</strong> (Dubai, United Arab Emirates), called "aira" or "we" below, and you, the creator named in the form on this page, called "you".</p>

<h2>1. Your code</h2>
<ul>
	<li>Your code gives your audience 15% off their order at shop-aira.com. Each customer can use it once. It cannot be combined with our multi-kit offer or with another code.</li>
	<li>A link that applies your code automatically, for your bio or link list: shop-aira.com/discount/YOURCODE.</li>
	<li>If you coach clients, you also get a client code: USD 8 off an order of USD 39.99 or more, limited to 5 uses. It cannot be combined with our multi-kit offer.</li>
	<li>We ship to the UAE and Saudi Arabia. Checkout shows prices and savings in AED or SAR.</li>
	<li>Please do not post your code on coupon or deal sites. If it appears on one, we may switch it off.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. What you get</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>A free aira kit,</strong> delivered to your address in the UAE or Saudi Arabia.</li>
	<li><strong>15% commission</strong> on every kit sold with your code (section 4).</li>
	<li><strong>Free refill pouches</strong> while you keep posting about aira, up to one pouch a month: just message Tom.</li>
	<li><strong>Every new product, before launch,</strong> for as long as we are working together.</li>
	<li><strong>Paid reach.</strong> When one of your Reels does well, we may boost it from your handle at our cost.</li>
	<li><strong>A partnership that grows.</strong> Once 20 orders have used your code, after refunds, your commission rises to 20% on the orders that follow. We may also commission paid videos from you at USD 100 each, at most one a month, each delivered with the raw clips and three opening hooks.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. What we ask from you</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>One Reel within 10 days of your kit arriving.</strong> On your own feed, 20 seconds or longer, showing you using aira and mentioning your code, with Instagram's Paid partnership label tagging @airabreathing. Use your own audio or royalty-free music, not a track from Instagram's music library, so the Reel can be boosted. Keep it up for at least 90 days.</li>
	<li><strong>More is welcome, never required.</strong> Extra Reels and Stories are up to you. The more you post, the more your code earns.</li>
	<li><strong>Your own experience, in your own words.</strong> Please make no medical claims about aira.</li>
	<li><strong>No direct competitors.</strong> While your code is active, please do not promote another nasal strip or nasal dilator.</li>
	<li><strong>Permits.</strong> You are responsible for holding any licence or permit your country requires for promotional posts, such as the UAE Advertiser Permit or the Saudi Mawthooq licence.</li>
	<li><strong>If no Reel is posted.</strong> We send a reminder on day 7. Ask before the deadline and you get 7 more days, once. After that the kit is charged at its listed price (USD 39.99 today) through a payment link, and your code is switched off until you pay or post.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Commission: how it works</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>Rate:</strong> 15% of the full kit price, before any discount, for every kit paid for in an order placed with your code or your client code. At USD 39.99 that is USD 6 a kit. Free kits from our offers, shipping, taxes and duties are not counted.</li>
	<li><strong>Tracking:</strong> through your code in our store. An order that does not use your code cannot be attributed to you.</li>
	<li><strong>Eligible orders:</strong> paid orders that are not cancelled or refunded. Commission on an order becomes payable 30 days after the order date. If an order is refunded after its commission has been paid, we deduct that commission from your next payout. Orders you place yourself do not earn commission.</li>
	<li><strong>Reporting:</strong> in the first week of each month we send you a summary of the previous month.</li>
	<li><strong>Payout:</strong> once a month in USD by bank transfer, when the amount payable is USD 50 or more. Smaller amounts roll over to the next month. We ask for your bank details before your first payout.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Content and usage rights</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>Your posts stay yours.</strong></li>
	<li><strong>The videos you make for this programme</strong> can be used by aira in paid ads and on our own channels for 12 months from the day you post them, across the GCC, and edited for the purpose: cut, captioned, or combined with other footage.</li>
	<li><strong>On request,</strong> you send us the partnership ad code for a Reel, and the finished video file if we need it. We do not ask for raw footage unless we are paying for the video.</li>
	<li><strong>Our promise:</strong> we edit for length and format, never to change what you said, and we only use your content to promote aira products.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Term, ending and the basics</h2>
<ul>
	<li>Starts when you submit this form and we issue your code. No fixed end date.</li>
	<li>Either of us can end it at any time by message. Commission on eligible orders placed before then is still paid on the normal schedule, and our 12-month right to use videos you have already posted continues. Ending before your first Reel does not cancel section 3.</li>
	<li>If a discount or commission rate ever needs to change, we agree it with you first. Changes never apply to orders already placed.</li>
	<li>This is an independent partnership, not employment or an agency. You are responsible for any tax on what we pay you.</li>
	<li>You confirm you are 18 or older.</li>
	<li>Please keep the sales figures and the terms here between us.</li>
	<li>Governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates.</li>
</ul>

<p>By ticking the box and typing your full name, you sign this agreement electronically. We sign by issuing your code.</p>
